## Slide 4

Referencing Custom Configuration

Views that contain Custom Properties are generated for each Entity

Custom configuration can be referenced with both the API and with SQL

Types can be loaded by key or used when loading their parent entities.
Custom Properties Dictionaries are available as a property of the parent entity. 
Custom Permissions can be checked against a user with a single-line API call.

